OL,3,GNEWSAFood shop fined #12,600 after rat
OL,4,Ainfestation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wolverhampton business and its
OL,7,Fdirector have been ordered to pay more
OL,8,Fthan #12,600 after a rat infestation
OL,9,Fwas discovered at a food shop, the city
OL,10,Fcouncil has said.
OL,12,FEnvironmental health officers closed
OL,13,FCitah Afro Caribbean Market in
OL,14,FLichfield Street in March last year,
OL,15,Fimmediately after an inspection.
OL,17,FThey allowed the shop to reopen later
OL,18,Fthe same month after cleaning, repairs
OL,19,Fand pest control treatment.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
