OL,3,GNEWSAFood shop fined #12,600 after rat
OL,4,Ainfestation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said that director Hannah
OL,7,FOtesanya and her business Citah Ltd had
OL,8,Fadmitted three food safety offences at
OL,9,FDudley Magistrates' Court last month.
